bounds. Arb ball arithmetic encloses the fixed checkpoint bits, functions, matrices, and all proof comparisons.

For negative results the search may stop on an infeasible subset of constraints: it first tests a root-commutativity
return path in Lean, and a valid identity-generator event (including its distractor tokens) in S5, selecting the state
